---
// src/components/Footer.astro
const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
---
<footer class="bg-[#3D2B1F] text-[#FDFCF0] pt-20 pb-10 mt-20">
  <div class="max-w-[1400px] mx-auto px-6">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-12 mb-16">
      
      <div class="col-span-1 md:col-span-1">
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-serif font-bold mb-6">Aires de Gredos</h3>
        <p class="text-stone-300 leading-relaxed mb-6">
          Llevamos lo mejor de nuestra tierra directamente a tu mesa. Artesanía, sabor y tradición de la Sierra de Gredos.
        </p>
        <div class="flex gap-4">
          <span class="text-2xl cursor-pointer hover:opacity-80">📸</span>
          <span class="text-2xl cursor-pointer hover:opacity-80">📘</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h4 class="font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-sm mb-6 text-[#8B5E3C]">Explorar</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-4 text-stone-300">
          <li><a href="/categoria/panaderia" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Panadería</a></li>
          <li><a href="/categoria/vinoteca" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Vinoteca</a></li>
          <li><a href="/contacto" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Dónde estamos</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h4 class="font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-sm mb-6 text-[#8B5E3C]">Contacto</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-4 text-stone-300">
          <li>📍 Navarredonda de Gredos, Ávila</li>
          <li>📞 +34 920 000 000</li>
          <li>✉️ hola@airesdegredos.com</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h4 class="font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-sm mb-6 text-[#8B5E3C]">Newsletter</h4>
        <p class="text-sm text-stone-300 mb-4">Recibe ofertas y noticias de nuestros artesanos.</p>
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
          <input type="email" placeholder="Tu email" class="bg-stone-800 border border-stone-700 rounded-lg px-4 py-2 focus:outline-none focus:border-[#8B5E3C] text-white" />
          <button class="bg-[#8B5E3C] text-white py-2 rounded-lg font-bold hover:bg-[#A67B5B] transition-colors">Suscribirme</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="border-t border-stone-800 pt-8 text-center text-stone-500 text-sm">
      <p>&copy; {currentYear} Aires de Gredos. Todos los derechos reservados.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>